  "current_gate": "Two gizmo preparation source guards are validating; this audit makes no production or test edits and does not start a build.",
  "scope": "Ordinary physical Pencil precision one-finger Changed paired PAN versus native node-link drag and node movement. Unoccluded node WINDOW; no active hardware drag, Pencil paint ticket, Knife paired-PAN suppression, ring/HUD/pointer capture or other modal owner.",
  "decisions": [
    {
      "case": "Already-live native node link",
      "status": "NO_ACTIONABLE_NAVIGATION_FALLTHROUGH",
      "finding": "node_link_modal consumes unmatched MOUSEPAN with RUNNING_MODAL. Its edge-pan helper ignores non-MOUSEMOVE. Normal View2D does not receive this paired PAN."
    },
    {
      "case": "Already-live native node transform or translate_attach macro",
      "status": "NO_ACTIONABLE_NAVIGATION_FALLTHROUGH",
      "finding": "Unhandled PAN returns RUNNING_MODAL|PASS_THROUGH; WM maps this exact combination to BREAK|MODAL. The macro preserves nonterminal flags. Ordinary region navigation is skipped."
    },
    {
      "case": "Before first CLICK_DRAG has acquired an owner",
      "status": "SOURCE_REACHABLE_NAVIGATION_CHANGE",
      "finding": "Physical Changed queues nonzero PAN before CURSOR. MOUSEPAN cannot synthesize CLICK_DRAG, so the preceding DOWN has no link/translate modal yet. The node WINDOW View2D keymap can immediately pan v2d.cur before the following cursor performs drag-threshold recognition. This is a concrete native source route; actual iPad frequency and effect are not measured."
    },
    {
      "case": "Native advanced PAN controls",
      "status": "PRESERVE",
      "finding": "Circle uses TRACKPADPAN as SIZE and Transform uses it as PROPORTIONAL_SIZE under native polling. A blanket Pencil/tool-name PAN suppression would remove supported behavior."
    }
  ],
  "event_trace": [
    "Began resets cached translation, queues CURSOR_MOVE then LEFT_BUTTON_DOWN at the recognized current touch point. It does not predict or acquire node link/translate ownership.",
    "Initial DOWN cannot match node.link or node.translate_attach because their evaluated ordinary left bindings require CLICK_DRAG. Box Select tool may select on PRESS; node selection remains nonmodal.",
    "Changed with nonzero relative translation queues PAN_GESTURE followed by CURSOR_MOVE. Generator preserves event_list insertion order.",
    "PAN_GESTURE becomes one-finger GHOST Trackpad Scroll with current coordinates and translation. WM maps it to MOUSEPAN, copies current coordinates into shared eventstate, and sets prev_xy from the delta.",
    "ISMOUSE_MOTION only includes MOUSEMOVE/INBETWEEN_MOUSEMOVE; MOUSEPAN therefore cannot enter motion-only CLICK_DRAG synthesis.",
    "With no higher-priority owner or occlusion, node WINDOW ED_KEYMAP_VIEW2D installs View2D. RNA TRACKPADPAN identifies MOUSEPAN; its default binding invokes view2d.pan. Native poll permits an unlocked node view. Apple guard only excludes File/Asset Shelf single-finger navigation.",
    "view_pan_invoke computes prev_xy-xy, applies view-pan, frees temporary state and finishes. view_pan_apply_ex modifies v2d.cur immediately and requests redraw/mousemove.",
    "Following CURSOR can cross drag threshold and synthesize CLICK_DRAG. node_link_invoke converts original drag-start pixels through the then-current v2d before node_link_init socket lookup. This ordering establishes a changed coordinate basis; this audit does not claim a guaranteed mislink or quantify the visible result.",
    "Once link or transform modal exists, subsequent paired PAN has the bounded consumption/native-control behavior described above. Native release/confirm/cancel remain unchanged."
  ],
